{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bang! Poom Poom! Blam! Boom!  </strong></h2><br>Hunt mischievous moorhuhns across a mystical campsite in the forest, shoot them down in the old walls of a knight's castle, or put your marksmanship to the test in a medieval marketplace. <br>If a wild chicken gets in the line of fire, blast it with a shotgun, rocket launcher, or chicken-hammer. Quickly load up on ammunition to enjoy maximum shooting action, and the chickens will either have to drop their feathers or end up roasting on the spit!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 exciting locations<br></li><li> 3 deadly weapons<br></li><li> Atmospheric settings<br></li><li> Offline multiplayer mode (1 vs 1, up to 4 players take turns in the hot seat)<br></li><li> Online high score</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1461140/0b1b6d59d003d2241d0f13d2265756fa66872e04.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1461140/67a319d8af3980a1ef6d7ee6bdd0d11a951cd32a.jpg"},{"name":"Master Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1461140/a0717657ec9db63e5301207cf4b7255997e8da9c.jpg"},{"name":"Hammertime!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1461140/4d0317a50670abd4fcb7534cf58bacbf00cab04f.jpg"},{"name":"Rocket Science","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1461140/2f4983dba53afafc68689aab21e7db8f29d5c69e.jpg"},{"name":"Village Kid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1461140/3d10a94066f8edbeaced6c0e4329bdfdc5b5926d.jpg"},{"name":"My home is my castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1461140/a4af8f7d4a78482f659f25747092570a945272fb.jpg"},{"name":"Chained","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu